message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "DP-GP-LVM"
abstract: >-
  A Bayesian non-parametric latent variable model that learns dependency structures across the dimensions of
  multivariate data. Gaussian process priors map the latent space to the data. A Dirichlet process prior groups the
  observed dimensions.
